'''Saucers''' (未確認飛行物体, ''Mikakunin Hikō Buttai'', '''Unidentified Flying Object''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

